  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Creeps and Curses V.3.1</em></p><p><em>████ and Light — Innate Technique (1st level)</em></p><blockquote><p>Your technique allows you to form killing intent into bars of light.</p></blockquote><p>At 1st level, you can form killing intent into light. You learn the Light cantrip. As a bonus action for 2 cursed energy, you mold killing intent into a bar of light in a free hand. This weapon lasts for 1 minute and counts as a simple melee weapon with which you are proficient. It deals 2d8 radiant damage on a hit and has the finesse, light, and thrown properties (range 20/60). Additionally, you can use your Cursed Energy modifier for attack and damage rolls using this weapon. If you drop the weapon or throw it, it dissipates and reappears in your hand.</p>",
